---
// DuoLedgerShowcase.astro
---

<section id="duoledger" class="py-24 bg-white relative overflow-hidden border-y border-[#F1F5F9]">
  
  <!-- Subtle decorative light gradients -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 -left-48 w-96 h-96 bg-[#6366F1]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 -right-48 w-96 h-96 bg-[#F43F5E]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4 mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FFE4E6] text-[#F43F5E] text-xs font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">
        <span>❤️ Producto Insignia</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#0F172A] tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">
        DuoLedger: Finanzas Compartidas para Parejas Modernas
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#64748B]">
        La aplicación móvil desarrollada por VibeCraft para que las parejas gestionen sus gastos comunes, salden deudas con un tap y alcancen metas de ahorro sin fricción.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Grid: Left Feature List + Center Phone Mockup + Right Feature List -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: 2 Features -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6 order-2 lg:order-1">
        
        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl glass-card-hover border border-[#F1F5F9]">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#EEF2FF] text-[#6366F1] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0F172A] mb-1 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Sync en Milisegundos</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748B] leading-relaxed">
            Basado en WebSockets bidireccionales con NestJS. Si tu pareja registra las compras en el supermercado, tu teléfono vibra y se actualiza al instante.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl glass-card-hover border border-[#F1F5F9]">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFE4E6] text-[#F43F5E] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7h12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4m0 6H4m0 0l4 4m-4-4l4-4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0F172A] mb-1 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">División Inteligente</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748B] leading-relaxed">
            Divide gastos 50/50, proporcional según los ingresos de cada uno (60/40), o 100% asumido por uno sin cálculos manuales.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Center Column: Interactive Realistic Smartphone Mockup -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex justify-center order-1 lg:order-2">
        <div class="relative w-full max-w-[340px] sm:max-w-[370px]">
          
          <!-- Outer Phone Frame -->
          <div class="relative rounded-[48px] p-3.5 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1E293B] to-[#0F172A] shadow-2xl shadow-[#6366F1]/20 border-4 border-[#334155]">
            
            <!-- Dynamic Island / Speaker notch -->
            <div class="absolute top-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-28 h-5 bg-black rounded-full z-30 flex items-center justify-center">
              <div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#1E293B] mr-2"></div>
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]/60"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Screen Area -->
            <div class="bg-[#F9FAFB] rounded-[38px] overflow-hidden pt-8 pb-4 px-4 text-[#0F172A] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] select-none">
              
              <!-- App Top Bar -->
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4 pt-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <img src="/icons/icono_duoledger.png" alt="DuoLedger Logo" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm object-contain" />
                  <div>
                    <span class="text-sm font-extrabold text-[#0F172A] tracking-tight">DuoLedger</span>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]"></span>
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B] font-medium">Sincronizado</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Couple Avatar Pill -->
                <div class="flex items-center -space-x-1.5 bg-white px-2 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#F1F5F9] shadow-xs">
                  <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#6366F1] text-white text-[10px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">Tú</div>
                  <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#F43F5E] text-white text-[10px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">Ca</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Realtime Balance Card (Inspired by balance_header_card.dart) -->
              <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-5 border border-[#F1F5F9] shadow-sm mb-4 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#64748B]">Balance con Camila</span>
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-[#ECFDF5] text-[#10B981]">
                    Te deben
                  </span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 my-1">
                  <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#10B981] tracking-tight">+$65.25</span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-[#64748B] font-medium">USD</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8] mb-3">Última actualización: hace 2 minutos</p>

                <div class="flex gap-2">
                  <button class="flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#6366F1] text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-sm shadow-[#6366F1]/20 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 hover:bg-[#4F46E5] transition-colors">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"/></svg>
                    Añadir Gasto
                  </button>
                  <button class="py-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-[#EEF2FF] text-[#4F46E5] text-xs font-bold hover:bg-[#E0E7FF] transition-colors">
                    Saldar
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Interactive Simulated Feed Section -->
              <div class="space-y-2 mb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-1">
                  <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0F172A]">Gastos Recientes</span>
                  <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#6366F1]">Ver todos</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Feed Item 1 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#F1F5F9] shadow-xs flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#FFF7ED] text-[#F97316] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">
                      🛒
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0F172A] leading-tight">Supermercado</p>
                      <p class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B]">Pagó Camila • 50/50</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-right">
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0F172A]">$84.50</p>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-[#F97316] font-semibold">debes $42.25</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Feed Item 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#F1F5F9] shadow-xs flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#FFE4E6] text-[#F43F5E] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">
                      🍕
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0F172A] leading-tight">Cena Italiana</p>
                      <p class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B]">Pagaste Tú • 50/50</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-right">
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0F172A]">$55.00</p>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-[#10B981] font-semibold">te debe $27.50</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Feed Item 3 -->
                <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#F1F5F9] shadow-xs flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-[#EEF2FF] text-[#6366F1] flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">
                      🎬
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0F172A] leading-tight">Netflix & Spotify</p>
                      <p class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B]">Pagaste Tú • 50/50</p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-right">
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[#0F172A]">$16.00</p>
                    <p class="text-[10px] text-[#10B981] font-semibold">te debe $8.00</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

              </div>

              <!-- Shared Savings Goal Progress Preview -->
              <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#EEF2FF] to-[#FFE4E6] p-3 rounded-2xl border border-[#E0E7FF]/60 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                  <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[#1E293B]">Meta: Viaje de Playa 🏖️</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B]">$950 de $1,200 ahorrados (79%)</p>
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#4F46E5]">+Aportar</span>
              </div>

            </div>

            <!-- Home indicator bar -->
            <div class="w-32 h-1 bg-white/40 rounded-full mx-auto mt-2"></div>

          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: 2 Features -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6 order-3">
        
        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl glass-card-hover border border-[#F1F5F9]">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#ECFDF5] text-[#10B981] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0F172A] mb-1 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">Saldado sin Fricción</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748B] leading-relaxed">
            Un solo toque calcula la transferencia neta óptima. Registra el pago en efectivo o transferencia bancaria y celebra con animación de confeti.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-3xl glass-card-hover border border-[#F1F5F9]">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFF7ED] text-[#F97316] flex items-center justify-center mb-4 shadow-sm">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0F172A] mb-1 font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">VaultS3 Storage</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#64748B] leading-relaxed">
            Fotografías de tickets, facturas y comprobantes guardados en almacenamiento privado y encriptado en nuestro cluster de VaultS3.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Official DuoLedger Branding Banner with Download / Beta link -->
    <div class="mt-16 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#6366F1] via-[#4F46E5] to-[#F43F5E] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-xl shadow-[#6366F1]/20 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3">
          <img src="/icons/icono_duoledger.png" alt="DuoLedger Logo" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/20 p-1 object-contain" />
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">¿Quieres probar DuoLedger?</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-white/80 max-w-xl text-sm sm:text-base">
          Estamos en fase de lanzamiento para parejas selectas en iOS y Android. Solicita acceso anticipado al TestFlight y APK privado.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 w-full md:w-auto">
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/?text=Hola%20VibeCraft,%20quiero%20acceso%20anticipado%20a%20la%20beta%20de%20DuoLedger."
          target="_blank"
          class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white text-[#4F46E5] font-bold text-sm shadow-md hover:bg-[#F8FAFC] transition-all text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          <span>Solicitar Beta en WhatsApp</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
